      "text": "What Rotamesh does\nRotamesh builds weekly staff rotas for cafes and restaurants from historical sales, staff availability and local trading rules. It writes the published rota back into Deputy and sends shift confirmations over SMS.\nThe workflow\nRotamesh works inside the weekly staff rota that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
